OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly
OL,6,Fcloudy night over Argyll with a few
OL,7,Fshowers possible overnight. Elsewhere
OL,8,Fwill stay dry with largely clear skies
OL,9,Fin the evening before turning cloudier
OL,10,Fovernight, cold and frosty here.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA cloudy day with some bright
OL,13,For sunny intervals, the best of these
OL,14,Ffurther east inland. A few showers
OL,15,Fdeveloping, particularly around coasts
OL,16,Fand over Argyll.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
